	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/mods_settings/prism_assets/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Gives weapons and armour the fine grain of their surfaces (machining, weave, wear) from a mod's material overlay. It changes only the light on them. Off draws them as the Xbox did."/>
		<string text="Lights characters, weapons and vehicles by the surface maps a mod carries for its remodels: their dents, seams and creases. Off draws them as the Xbox did."/>
		<string text="Draws the sharper textures mods ship in place of the game's, once they are in the graphics card's memory. Stock draws the game's own."/>
		<string text="How much of the graphics card's memory mods' textures may take. Auto takes six tenths of what is free; past it, those not seen lately go back to the game's."/>
		<string text="Lights armour and weapons with the materials mods give them: their colour, bumps, roughness, metal and coats under the level's own lights. Stock draws them as the Xbox did."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Draws the remodelled characters, weapons and vehicles mods ship in place of the game's, on the game's own skeletons: animations, collision and aim are unchanged. Stock draws the game's own."/>
		<string text="How much of the graphics card's memory mods' remodels may take. Auto takes a fifth of what is free; a remodel past it is drawn as the game's."/>
		<string text="A remodel's pouches swing and its joints keep their volume as it moves. Off: they follow the bones they hang from."/>
	</strings>
